SUMMARY:Danvers Boys Soccer vs Beverly (L 0–5)
LOCATION:Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 0\, Beverly 5\nDanvers 
