DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T160000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Boys Soccer at Gloucester (L 1–2)
LOCATION:Newell Stadium\, Gloucester
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 1\, Gloucester 2\nMatthew McCrea sco
 red to give the Falcons a 1–0 halftime lead\, but Gloucester tied it on 
 a shot that deflected off a Danvers defender and won it about five minutes
  from the end off a corner kick. "Danvers is a nice young team\, they put 
 up a good fight\," Gloucester coach Armando Marnoto said.\nSchedule and re
 sults: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=boys
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/soccer/schedule.html?team=boys
